# DsTextarea docs snippets

## Default

### Show code
<DsTextarea
  placeholder="Enter your text here..."
  rows={3}
/>

### MCP manifest
const Default = () => <DsTextarea placeholder="Enter your text here..." rows={3} />;

## Disabled

### Show code
<DsTextarea
  disabled
  placeholder="Disabled textarea"
  value="This textarea is disabled"
/>

### MCP manifest
const Disabled = () => <DsTextarea
    value="This textarea is disabled"
    disabled
    placeholder="Disabled textarea" />;

## Max Length

### Show code
<DsTextarea
  maxLength={50}
  placeholder="Maximum 50 characters allowed"
  rows={3}
/>

### MCP manifest
const MaxLength = () => <DsTextarea placeholder="Maximum 50 characters allowed" maxLength={50} rows={3} />;